rbr_full_MustTerminate=⊢ ∀c perf body bs frame. post_alloc_conventions (FST frame) (MustTerminate body) ∧ 4 ≤ FST frame ∧ (perf ⇔ F) ⇒ reg_bound (FST (comp c perf (MustTerminate body) bs frame)) (FST frame + 2)
rbr_full_Loop=⊢ ∀c perf liveIn body liveOut bs frame. post_alloc_conventions (FST frame) (Loop liveIn body liveOut) ∧ 4 ≤ FST frame ∧ (perf ⇔ F) ⇒ reg_bound (FST (comp c perf (Loop liveIn body liveOut) bs frame)) (FST frame + 2)
rbr_full_Seq=⊢ ∀c perf first second bs frame. post_alloc_conventions (FST frame) (Seq first second) ∧ 4 ≤ FST frame ∧ (perf ⇔ F) ⇒ reg_bound (FST (comp c perf (Seq first second) bs frame)) (FST frame + 2)
rbr_full_If=⊢ ∀c perf cmp reg ri first second bs frame. post_alloc_conventions (FST frame) (If cmp reg ri first second) ∧ 4 ≤ FST frame ∧ (perf ⇔ F) ⇒ reg_bound (FST (comp c perf (If cmp reg ri first second) bs frame)) (FST frame + 2)
rbr_full_CallTail=⊢ ∀c perf dest args handler bs frame. post_alloc_conventions (FST frame) (Call NONE dest args handler) ∧ 4 ≤ FST frame ∧ (perf ⇔ F) ⇒ reg_bound (FST (comp c perf (Call NONE dest args handler) bs frame)) (FST frame + 2)
rbr_full_CallReturn=⊢ ∀c perf values live retCode l1 l2 dest args bs frame. post_alloc_conventions (FST frame) (Call (SOME (values,live,retCode,l1,l2)) dest args NONE) ∧ 4 ≤ FST frame ∧ (perf ⇔ F) ⇒ reg_bound (FST (comp c perf (Call (SOME (values,live,retCode,l1,l2)) dest args NONE) bs frame)) (FST frame + 2)
rbr_full_CallHandler=⊢ ∀c perf values live retCode l1 l2 dest args handleValue handleCode h1 h2 bs frame. post_alloc_conventions (FST frame) (Call (SOME (values,live,retCode,l1,l2)) dest args (SOME (handleValue,handleCode,h1,h2))) ∧ 4 ≤ FST frame ∧ (perf ⇔ F) ⇒ reg_bound (FST (comp c perf (Call (SOME (values,live,retCode,l1,l2)) dest args (SOME (handleValue,handleCode,h1,h2))) bs frame)) (FST frame + 2)
